From 02351021517a71c8dd6816ffb0f0b54dfa4aeb26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@aol.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:23:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 10/25] MSL: Emulate min/max sampler reduction

Options::emulate_sampler_reduction: each sampler in an argument buffer has its reduction mode
and filters in its set's spvBufferSizeConstants. 2D and 2D array samples through a min or max
sampler reduce the texels of their footprint (each sampled at its center, so the sampler's
addressing applies) on one or both mips; other samples are unchanged.
---
 main.cpp      |   3 +
 spirv_msl.cpp | 193 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 spirv_msl.hpp |  14 ++++
 3 files changed, 210 insertions(+)

